{{Term/Store|Bushy-Tailed Squirrel|Bushy-Tailed Squirrels|Series, BotW, TotK|plural}} are recurring [[Creature]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite|'''Bushy-Tailed Squirrel'''|Hyrule Compendium|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|'''Bushy-Tailed Squirrel'''|Hyrule Compendium|TotK}}</ref>

==Characteristics==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Bushy-Tailed Squirrel}}
Bushy-Tailed Squirrels are a brown species of [[Squirrel]] with a beige underbelly. They are known for their large tails, which are their namesake.<ref name="Compendium">{{Cite|These small creatures are known for their large tails. They tend to live in forests and subsist on acorns and other nuts. They carry their food in their mouths but will sometimes drop it when surprised in an adorable display of shock.|Hyrule Compendium|BotW}}</ref> Commonly, they live in forests in [[Hyrule Field]] and [[Hyrule Ridge]], but they can also be found in most [[Region]]s of [[Hyrule]].<ref name="Compendium"/> When they are disturbed, Bushy-Tailed Squirrels will flee. Their diet mainly consists of nuts, which they carry in their mouths and drop when attacked.<ref name="Compendium"/> If [[Link]] kills a Bushy-Tailed Squirrel, it will drop an [[Acorn]].

